{"3130050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stellar Odyssey", "steam_appid": 3130050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Competitive Space Combat Game With a Persistent Universe</h2><br>Pilot powerful ships, master different weapons, compete on the leaderboards, and prepare for a growing online universe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arena and the Persistent Online Universe</h2><br><strong>Arena</strong> is the competitive side of Stellar Odyssey. Play Solo, Party, Versus, or Versus AI with free movement space combat. Improve your build, chase high scores, and compete against other pilots for MMR.<br><br><strong>The Persistent Online Universe</strong> will expand that same pilot identity into a shared galaxy. Explore star systems, mine resources, trade, join factions, form corporations, and encounter other players.<br><br>Arena is where you sharpen your combat skills. The Persistent Online Universe is where your pilot, progression, and choices become part of a larger galaxy.<br><br><i>The Persistent Online Universe is currently in development and will arrive in a future update.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Arena Combat</strong><br>Play Solo, Party, Versus, and Versus AI modes with fast-paced free movement space combat.<br><br></li><li><strong>High Scores and MMR</strong><br>Climb the Arena leaderboards, improve your performance, and compete for a higher rating.<br><br></li><li><strong>Shared Pilot Progression</strong><br>Develop your pilot through Arena combat and future universe activities. Unlock abilities, improve your ships, and shape your playstyle.<br><br></li><li><strong>Ship Customization</strong><br>Customize your hull, weapons, equipment, abilities, and visual style.<br><br></li><li><strong>Persistent Online Universe</strong><br>Explore a growing galaxy filled with star systems, planets, anomalies, resources, and hidden locations.<br><br></li><li><strong>Mining and Trading</strong><br>Mine asteroids, collect valuable resources, trade goods, and manage your supplies.<br><br></li><li><strong>Factions and Corporations</strong><br>Choose your alliances, work with other players, and form corporations to compete for resources and influence.<br><br></li><li><strong>Story and Discovery</strong><br>Uncover the secrets of the galaxy through missions, transmissions, and an evolving storyline.<br><br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Play with friends, compete against other pilots, and take part in a universe shaped by player actions.<br><br></li><li><strong>Steam Workshop and Modding</strong><br>Development tools are planned to support community-created content and Steam Workshop integration.<br><br></li><li><strong>Custom Networking and Anti-Cheat</strong><br>Stellar Odyssey is being built with custom networking and anti-cheat systems designed to support fair competitive play.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Competitive Space Combat Game With a Persistent Universe</h2><br>Pilot powerful ships, master different weapons, compete on the leaderboards, and prepare for a growing online universe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Arena and the Persistent Online Universe</h2><br><strong>Arena</strong> is the competitive side of Stellar Odyssey. Play Solo, Party, Versus, or Versus AI with free movement space combat. Improve your build, chase high scores, and compete against other pilots for MMR.<br><br><strong>The Persistent Online Universe</strong> will expand that same pilot identity into a shared galaxy. Explore star systems, mine resources, trade, join factions, form corporations, and encounter other players.<br><br>Arena is where you sharpen your combat skills. The Persistent Online Universe is where your pilot, progression, and choices become part of a larger galaxy.<br><br><i>The Persistent Online Universe is currently in development and will arrive in a future update.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Arena Combat</strong><br>Play Solo, Party, Versus, and Versus AI modes with fast-paced free movement space combat.<br><br></li><li><strong>High Scores and MMR</strong><br>Climb the Arena leaderboards, improve your performance, and compete for a higher rating.<br><br></li><li><strong>Shared Pilot Progression</strong><br>Develop your pilot through Arena combat and future universe activities. Unlock abilities, improve your ships, and shape your playstyle.<br><br></li><li><strong>Ship Customization</strong><br>Customize your hull, weapons, equipment, abilities, and visual style.<br><br></li><li><strong>Persistent Online Universe</strong><br>Explore a growing galaxy filled with star systems, planets, anomalies, resources, and hidden locations.<br><br></li><li><strong>Mining and Trading</strong><br>Mine asteroids, collect valuable resources, trade goods, and manage your supplies.<br><br></li><li><strong>Factions and Corporations</strong><br>Choose your alliances, work with other players, and form corporations to compete for resources and influence.<br><br></li><li><strong>Story and Discovery</strong><br>Uncover the secrets of the galaxy through missions, transmissions, and an evolving storyline.<br><br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Play with friends, compete against other pilots, and take part in a universe shaped by player actions.<br><br></li><li><strong>Steam Workshop and Modding</strong><br>Development tools are planned to support community-created content and Steam Workshop integration.<br><br></li><li><strong>Custom Networking and Anti-Cheat</strong><br>Stellar Odyssey is being built with custom networking and anti-cheat systems designed to support fair competitive play.</li></ul>", "short_description": "A sci-fi space combat game where you pilot customizable ships, fight alone, team up, or challenge other players in free-movement Arena battles, climb leaderboards, and develop your 